WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,940 --> 00:00:03,340
That's it

2
00:00:03,540 --> 00:00:07,180
The ancestor has been calling for a lifetime to get here.

3
00:00:07,610 --> 00:00:09,410
I touched it in half an hour

4
00:00:14,930 --> 00:00:16,330
The steel is ground out

5
00:00:16,530 --> 00:00:17,930
But it’s clearly written in the book

6
00:00:18,130 --> 00:00:20,530
This kind of sand trick can only really survive if you see blood

7
00:00:20,760 --> 00:00:22,560
Gesturing in the air in the backyard

8
00:00:22,560 --> 00:00:23,960
It’s just a flower stand after all

9
00:00:24,160 --> 00:00:25,160
Keep practicing

10
00:00:25,160 --> 00:00:27,160
It's just a deeper scratch

11
00:00:27,780 --> 00:00:28,780
People can't die

12
00:00:28,780 --> 00:00:30,780
You can't defeat the Decepticon even if you recruit him.

13
00:00:31,390 --> 00:00:32,990
Dad said this is the foundation of our family

14
00:00:33,190 --> 00:00:34,790
But I don’t even have meridians

15
00:00:35,150 --> 00:00:36,350
So angry about this thing

16
00:00:36,350 --> 00:00:37,950
It's like shouting through a wall

17
00:00:38,350 --> 00:00:39,950
There will never be memories inside the wall

18
00:00:40,580 --> 00:00:42,780
The only thing I can do to bother him is to remind myself that I have a useless pulse.

19
00:00:42,980 --> 00:00:43,980
Just adds to the upset

20
00:00:44,180 --> 00:00:45,180
Leave one side

21
00:00:45,610 --> 00:00:46,810
I haven't touched this one before.

22
00:00:47,440 --> 00:00:48,840
Dad used to bang the table when he was drunk

23
00:00:49,040 --> 00:00:51,440
He said that if our ancestors left early with Taizu,

24
00:00:51,840 --> 00:00:53,840
It’s time for the Duke’s whip to be hung in the Li family ancestral hall

25
00:00:54,040 --> 00:00:55,040
Iron frame picture

26
00:00:55,440 --> 00:00:57,040
How many bags can be killed by three words?

27
00:00:57,730 --> 00:01:00,090
Can you still breathe when you get here?
